[engl]
{100}{}{Morbid}
{200}{}{You see Doc Morbid.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> Morbid17]}
{2000}{}{Now, half of what you have just seen is mine again.}
{2010}{}{YOU RIPPED OUT MY EYE! YOU MOTHER . . .}
{3000}{}{Now, now. Watch your language.}
{3010}{}{[Done.]}
{4000}{}{Trespasser! This is a private room!}
{4010}{}{[Done.]}
{5000}{}{Don't try to talk your way out of this one!}
{5010}{}{[Done.]}
{6000}{}{Oh, It's a customer! What can I help you with?}
{6010}{}{I need healing.}
{6020}{}{Wock!}
{6030}{}{I know about you and Iguana Bob, you filthy butcher.}
{6040}{}{Nothing, just making small talk.}
{6050}{}{You seem exited to see me. Why?}
{7000}{}{Hmm, lets have a look.}
{7010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Morbid04]}
{7020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Morbid09]}
{8000}{}{You seem to be in nearly perfect health. That will be $10 for the examination.}
{8010}{}{Ten caps for you to tell me that? You gotta be kidding.}
{8020}{}{Here you go. Take your money.}
{9000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Morbid04a']}
{9010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Morbid05]}
{10000}{}{I never joke. Especially when it comes to physical trauma. You will pay or I'll have to
resort to other forms of compensation, many of which are much more painful then just
paying my fee.}
{10010}{}{Ok, here's your money.}
{10020}{}{Bite me. I'm leaving.}
{11000}{}{Thank you for your business. Come again.}
{11010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Morbid08]}
{12000}{}{You do not have enough money. I have a very special way of dealing with debtors - I
don't. Flash and Cougar, take our new found source of income to the lab for processing.}
{12010}{}{[Done.]}
{13000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Morbid05a']}
{13010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Morbid06]}
{14000}{}{Have it your way. Cougar, Flash. Show our 'patient' to the lab.}
{14010}{}{[Done.]}
{15000}{}{You are
---
perfectly healthy,
---
slightly wounded,
---
moderately wounded,
---
seriously wounded,
---
near death,
---
You have minor radiation poisoning.
---
You have some serious radiation poisoning.
---
Your body has absorbed an incredible amount of radiation.
---
I have never seen such readings on my radscanner. I think you are about to die. I give
you two to three weeks.
---
There is not much I can do about it.
---
Ok, I have your test results:}
{15010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Morbid09a]}
{16000}{}{The total cost will be $
---
. Payment is due before treatment. No exceptions. Will you pay?}
{16010}{}{Yes, I will pay.}
{16020}{}{Ya.}
{16030}{}{No, I don't have the money. Will you float me?}
{16040}{}{No.}
{16050}{}{Nuh.}
{17000}{}{Excellent. Let's begin. This might hurt a little . . .
---
There you go. Come back again!}
{17010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Morbid08]}
{17020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> UpReact]}
{18000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'UpReact']}
{18010}{}{[Done.]}
{19000}{}{No. I don't loan anyone, and I mean anyone, any amount of money. Go away, you pauper.}
{19010}{}{[Done.]}
{20000}{}{It's your life. Good-Bye.}
{20010}{}{[Done.]}
{21000}{}{Wh . . . what could you possibly mean?}
{21010}{}{I had a little conversation with your troll . . .}
{22000}{}{[He looks shiftily from side to side] That proves nothing. Gretch is a little . . . slow
in the head. No one listens to him around here. You had best leave.}
{22010}{}{[Done.]}
{23000}{}{Well, if you do need anything, please stop by. No one can beat my service!}
{23010}{}{[Done.]}
{24000}{}{My business has dropped off recently. I'm happy to see any customers, these days. Not
that I mind your company, of course.}
{24010}{}{Excellent, I need some healing.}
{24020}{}{Of course, I understand. Have a good day.}
{24030}{}{Why has your business dropped off?}
{25000}{}{In case you haven't noticed, I got some competition.
---
Complaining to Killian won't do anything. He doesn't see anything wrong with the
newcomers.
---
Those damn Children have moved in next door, and all, um, much of my business has gone
to them. I don't like it, but I can't lower my prices to match theirs. I can only
provide better service.}
{25010}{}{Ahh, I do need some healing.}
{25020}{}{Hmm, better prices, interesting. Thank you.}
{26000}{}{Ahh, a repeat customer. Excellent these days! How can I help you?}
{26010}{}{I need healing.}
{26020}{}{Nothing, just making small talk.}
{26030}{}{Wock!}
{26040}{}{I know about you and Iguana Bob, you filthy butcher.}
{27000}{}{You again. I hope you have another good reason for disturbing me . . .}
{27010}{}{Aggh!}
{28000}{}{I'm sorry, I don't treat idiots at night. Something about full moons and lunacy, I
suppose. Have a good night.}
{28010}{}{[Done.]}
{29000}{}{I hope you have a good reason for disturbing me. My time is extremely valuable.}
{29010}{}{Aggh!}
{30000}{}{Oh, back so soon. What can I help you with?}
{30010}{}{I need healing.}
{30020}{}{Wock!}
{30030}{}{I know about you and Iguana Bob, you filthy butcher.}
{30040}{}{Nothing, just making small talk.}
{31000}{}{Please make it somewhere else, I'm busy.}
{31010}{}{[Done.]}
{32000}{}{Oh, It's you again. I like your style, even if I don't like you. What can I help you
with, now?}
{32010}{}{I need healing.}
{32020}{}{Wock!}
{32030}{}{Nothing, just making small talk.}
{33000}{}{I'm Doc Morbid, can I help you?}
{33010}{}{Yeah, I need some help.}
{33020}{}{I need some medical assistance.}
{33030}{}{Ya.}
{33040}{}{No, not today.}
{33050}{}{I know about you and Iguana Bob, you filthy butcher.}
{34000}{}{Well, if not today, then perhaps sometime in the near future.}
{34010}{}{Hopefully not. Bye.}
{35000}{}{Hmmm. I don't like your looks, stranger. But what can I do for you? I never, ever turn
away a paying customer.}
{35010}{}{I need some help.}
{35020}{}{I need some medical assistance.}
{35030}{}{Hep.}
{35040}{}{Nothing today, thanks.}

